        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Scylladon and its Tentacles are immune to this poison. The sickened condition from this poison disappears on successfully reducing the stage of the poison to 1. It can also be removed by retching, but is reapplied when the poison deals damage if still on the respective stage.</p><p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:37] save; Maximum Duration 10 rounds.</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[4d6[acid]] damage (1 round).</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[5d6[acid]] damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (1 round).</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[6d6[acid]] damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (1 round).</p>"
