          "value": "<p>Scylladon creates a swirling torrent in @Template[type:line|distance:150], dealing @Damage[17d6[bludgeoning]] damage to all creatures with a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:37|basic] save. Creatures and objects that fail the save are also knocked back 5 feet (10 feet on a critical failure).</p><p>Scylladon cannot use Water Jet again for [[/r 1d4]] rounds.</p>"
